<title>FINLAND: EXTRA 405 MLN MARKKA OF 2004 BONDS SOLD - STO.</title>
<headline>EXTRA 405 MLN MARKKA OF 2004 BONDS SOLD - STO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish State Treasury Office (STO) said on Friday benchmark market makers had purchased the offered extra 405 million markka of bonds maturing in 2004 after Thursday's auction.</p>
<p>The price was 120.40 compared to 120.20 at Thursday's auction. The yield was 5.94 percent compared to 5.97 at the auction, an STO spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0247</p>
</text>
